# The portal's scheduled jobs on its own server (migration plan, steps p4-crontab
# and p3-cron), in UTC. src/lib/cron-schedule.test.ts checks each line calls a
# job that exists.
#
# Install as root:  crontab -u portal /opt/tnportal/app/deploy/cron/portal.crontab
# Each line calls one job on the portal running on this machine (run.sh).
CRON_TZ=UTC
SHELL=/bin/bash
PORTAL_DIR=/opt/tnportal/app

0 1,5,9,13,17,21 * * *   $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/ingest
30 1,5,9,13,17,21 * * *  $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/tsheets-sync
55 1,5,9,13,17,21 * * * $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/health
45 1,5,9,13,17,21 * * *  $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/clocky-delta
15 1,5,9,13,17,21 * * *  $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/monday-worklist
*/15 * * * *             $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/daily-summary
# Clocky's safety net: "Still working?" at 4h 30m, the automatic stop at 5h 00m.
*/5 * * * *              $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/clocky-safety
# Clocky part 2, day 1 at 11:00 UTC (06:00 or 07:00 New York): the fixed, no
# timesheet invoices for the month that ended. Off until Clocky part 2 is in
# production (owner, 20 October 2026: nothing of Clocky goes to production
# until asked); uncomment it in the same promotion.
# 0 11 1 * *               $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/clocky-invoices
# Clocky part 2, every 5 minutes: the outbox (Rippling and Google Calendar).
# Off until Clocky part 2 is in production, like the line above.
# */5 * * * *              $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/clocky-outbox
# Clocky part 2, every hour: the timesheet reminders (9:00 AM in each person's
# zone) and the allowance lines. Off until Clocky part 2 is in production.
# 5 * * * *                $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/clocky-reminders
# North Time rollout, every hour: archives each person's TSheets account on
# their North Time start date. A dry run (logs only) unless the portal's env
# has TSHEETS_ARCHIVE_USERS=on. Off until North Time is in production.
# 20 * * * *               $PORTAL_DIR/deploy/cron/run.sh /api/cron/north-time-archive
